# Milestone: v0.9.4
# Covers: every (period) body — periodic-spawn smoke test.
# Verifies the body fires at least once when the chunk is driven enough
# cooperative steps between REPL lines for the timer wake to fire.
#
# Mechanism: every(1us, body_fn) registers a UPeriodic with the runtime.
# urbi_step's per-call sleep-queue drain wakes the body strand whose
# next_fire_us has elapsed; the body then runs, increments fired, and
# the periodic re-arms for the next period.
#
# REPL drives urbi_step via the URBI_REPL_DRAIN_BUDGET loop after each
# line is evaluated.  The trailing reads after the every() install
# cumulatively pump enough urbi_step calls that fired transitions from
# 0 to at-least-1 before the inspect line executes.

var fired = 0;
every (1us) Realm.fired = Realm.fired + 1;
0;
0;
Realm.fired > 0
[00000000] 0
[00000000] nil
[00000000] 0
[00000000] 0
[00000000] true
